# Mirakl

> Mirakl is the global leader in platform business innovation. We power online marketplaces, dropship programs, and connected catalog platforms for enterprise retailers, distributors, and manufacturers — and the connection layer that lets sellers reach those buyers at scale.

## What Mirakl does

- Operators run third-party marketplaces, dropship programs, and B2B trade platforms on Mirakl's commerce infrastructure.
- Sellers connect once and distribute their catalog to hundreds of channels through Mirakl Connect.
- AI-powered listing optimization, catalog enrichment, retail-media, and agentic-commerce tooling sit on top of the core platform.

## Products

- [Marketplace Platform](https://www.mirakl.com/products/marketplace-platform): launch a third-party marketplace.
- [Dropship Platform](https://www.mirakl.com/products/dropship-platform): expand assortment via direct-from-supplier fulfillment.
- [Mirakl Connect](https://www.mirakl.com/products/connect): seller-side network — one integration, hundreds of channels, AI-adapted listings.
- [Mirakl Ads](https://www.mirakl.com/products/ads): retail-media platform for marketplace operators.
- [Agentic Activation](https://www.mirakl.com/products/agentic-activation): make catalogs discoverable to AI shopping agents.

## B2C & B2B

- [Seller management](https://www.mirakl.com/b2c-b2b/seller-management): run a healthy seller network with automated quality controls.
